msgid "Frequency"
msgstr "Frecuencia"

#: po/paper-catalog.js:179
msgid ""
"Frequency of the noise, 0 to 1 mapped internally to 0 to 18; higher is "
"finer, needs spread > 0, noise > 0"
msgstr ""
"Frecuencia del ruido; 0 a 1 se convierte internamente en 0 a 18; los valores "
"altos producen más detalle; requiere spread > 0 y noise > 0"

#: po/paper-catalog.js:180
msgid ""
"Frequency step, defines how compressed the pattern is, needs octaveCount > 1 "
